# Application
APP_NAME=golang-api-starter
APP_ENV=development
APP_PORT=8080
APP_DEBUG=true

# Database Configuration
DB_DRIVER=postgres
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DB_USER=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=postgres
DB_NAME=golang_api_db
DB_SSLMODE=disable
DB_MAX_OPEN_CONNS=25
DB_MAX_IDLE_CONNS=5
DB_CONN_MAX_LIFETIME=5m

# JWT Configuration
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-jwt-key-change-this-in-production-min-32-chars
JWT_EXPIRATION_HOURS=24
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRATION_HOURS=168

# Rate Limiting
RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS=100
RATE_LIMIT_DURATION=1m

# Concurrency
WORKER_POOL_SIZE=10
MAX_CONCURRENT_JOBS=100

# Logging
LOG_LEVEL=info
LOG_FILE_PATH=logs/app.log
LOG_MAX_SIZE=100
LOG_MAX_BACKUPS=30
LOG_MAX_AGE=90

# Migration
MIGRATION_PATH=file://migrations
```

**Penjelasan:**
- `DB_DRIVER` = Pilih postgres atau mysql
- `JWT_SECRET` = Secret key untuk sign JWT (min 32 karakter!)
- `RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS` = Max 100 requests per menit
- `LOG_MAX_AGE` = Log disimpan 90 hari

---

### Step 4: File `.gitignore`

Buat file `.gitignore` di root:
```
# Binaries
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
bin/
dist/

# Test binary
*.test
*.out

# Go workspace file
go.work

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Swagger docs (auto-generated)
docs/docs.go
docs/swagger.json
docs/swagger.yaml